{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Java code to GNU C++11 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Java 8 code to GNU C++11 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Java 8 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport java.util.Arrays;\nimport java.util.Scanner;\n\npublic class C {\n    static int inf = (int) 1e6;\n    static int[][][][] DP;\n    static String number;\n    static int[] weight;\n\n    public static int get(int index, int pos, int neg, int carry) {\n        int truCarry = carry - 50;\n        if (index == 17) {\n            return (pos + neg + truCarry == 0) ? 0 : inf;\n        }\n        if (DP[index][pos][neg][carry] != -1)\n            return DP[index][pos][neg][carry];\n        int res = inf;\n        int digit = number.charAt(index) - '0';\n        for (int p = 0; p <= Math.min(15, pos); p++) {\n            for (int n = 0; n <= Math.min(15, neg); n++) {\n                int sum = pos - neg + truCarry;\n                int currentBit = (sum % 10 + 10) % 10;\n                int nextCarry = sum > 0 ? sum / 10 : (sum - 9) / 10;\n                if (currentBit != digit) continue;\n                int cost = (p + n) * weight[index];\n                res = Math.min(res,\n                        get(index + 1, pos - p, neg - n, nextCarry + 50) + cost);\n            }\n        }\n        return DP[index][pos][neg][carry] = res;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner in = new Scanner(System.in);\n        long n = in.nextLong();\n        int size = 50;\n        DP = new int[20][size][size][100];\n        for (int i = 0; i < 20; i++)\n            for (int j = 0; j < size; j++)\n                for (int k = 0; k < size; k++)\n                    Arrays.fill(DP[i][j][k], -1);\n        number = \"\" + n;\n        while (number.length() < 17)\n            number = \"0\" + number;\n        number = new StringBuilder(number).reverse().toString();\n        weight = new int[17];\n        for (int i = 0; i < 17; i++) weight[i] = i + 1;\n        int res = inf;\n        for (int pos = 0; pos < size; pos++)\n            for (int neg = 0; neg < size; neg++)\n                res = Math.min(res, get(0, pos, neg, 50));\n        System.out.println(res);\n    }\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 1.0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n#include <algorithm>\n#include <vector>\n#include <climits>\n\nusing namespace std;\n\nconst int INF = 1000000;\nconst int SIZE = 50; // size for pos, neg\nconst int MAX_INDEX = 17; // number of digits\nconst int CARRY_SIZE = 100; // 0..99\n\nvector<int> DP(MAX_INDEX * SIZE * SIZE * CARRY_SIZE, -1);\nstring number;\nvector<int> weight(MAX_INDEX);\n\ninline int dp_index(int idx, int pos, int neg, int carry) {\n    return ((idx * SIZE + pos) * SIZE + neg) * CARRY_SIZE + carry;\n}\n\nint get(int index, int pos, int neg, int carry) {\n    int truCarry = carry - 50;\n    if (index == 17) {\n        return (pos + neg + truCarry == 0) ? 0 : INF;\n    }\n    int idx = dp_index(index, pos, neg, carry);\n    if (DP[idx] != -1)\n        return DP[idx];\n    int res = INF;\n    int digit = number[index] - '0';\n    for (int p = 0; p <= min(15, pos); p++) {\n        for (int n = 0; n <= min(15, neg); n++) {\n            int sum = pos - neg + truCarry;\n            int currentBit = ((sum % 10) + 10) % 10;\n            int nextCarry = (sum > 0) ? sum / 10 : (sum - 9) / 10;\n            if (currentBit != digit) continue;\n            int cost = (p + n) * weight[index];\n            res = min(res,\n                      get(index + 1, pos - p, neg - n, nextCarry + 50) + cost);\n        }\n    }\n    DP[idx] = res;\n    return res;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    long long n;\n    cin >> n;\n    // pad number to 17 digits\n    number = to_string(n);\n    while (number.length() < 17) {\n        number = \"0\" + number;\n    }\n    reverse(number.begin(), number.end());\n    for (int i = 0; i < 17; i++) {\n        weight[i] = i + 1;\n    }\n    int res = INF;\n    for (int pos = 0; pos < SIZE; pos++) {\n        for (int neg = 0; neg < SIZE; neg++) {\n            res = min(res, get(0, pos, neg, 50));\n        }\n    }\n    cout << res << endl;\n    return 0;\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.99\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.0001262346631847322, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.001212338567711413, -0.0012331746984273195, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.00019572250312194228, -3.540453326422721e-05, 0.0, 0.0, -0.00012909532233607024, -2.1457441107486375e-05, 0.0, 0.0, -0.0015049570938572288, -1.4781842764932662e-05, 0.0, 0.0, -0.0006632988806813955, -0.20143593847751617, -0.0009296386269852519, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.4141930937767029, 0.0, 0.0, -0.02718833088874817, -0.826564371585846, -2.753696753643453e-05, 0.0, -0.0001062098381225951, -6.16293036728166e-05, -1.311301275563892e-06, -0.0005695389700122178, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.014712881296873093, -0.011050336994230747, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -7.390948667307384e-06, -0.006799772847443819, -0.05967273935675621, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.2701581120491028, -9.357491217087954e-05, 0.0, -0.00013565097469836473, -4.512535095214844, -0.15002267062664032, -1.9808392524719238, -0.0321163013577461